OL,3,GNEWSADrone ban during Tour of Britain
OL,4,Acycle race
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrone operators have been warned not to
OL,7,Ffly them during the Tour of Britain
OL,8,Fcycle race.
OL,10,FStage three of the event will pass
OL,11,Fthrough East Yorkshire on Friday and a
OL,12,FNotice to Airmen (NOTAM) order has been
OL,13,Fissued prohibiting flying over the
OL,14,Fcounty up to an altitude of 2,700 ft
OL,15,F(823m).
OL,17,FIt means that permission to fly in the
OL,18,Farea between 08:45 and 15:45 BST needs
OL,19,Fto be obtained from Humberside Police.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,384,380,200,160,0,100
