OL,3,GNEWSADrone ban during Tour of Britain
OL,4,Acycle race
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said the ban was "to maximise
OL,7,Fsafety to the public and other aircraft
OL,8,Fwhich will be operating" including
OL,9,Fpolice drones and media filming from
OL,10,Fthe air.
